<title>USA: Western Resources to proceed with ADT offer.</title>
<headline>Western Resources to proceed with ADT offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Resources Inc said it plans to proceed with its unsolicited $3.5 billion offer to buy electronic security giant ADT Ltd.</p>
<p>ADT earlier Wednesday rejected the bid as inadequate.</p>
<p>&quot;We still intend to move forward with our offer which we believe is a fair offer...&quot; a Western Resources spokeswoman said. She did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Western holds a 27 percent stake in ADT.</p>
<p>((--Robin Sidel, 212-859-1723.))</p>
</text>
